{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43940","headline":"杂言寄杜羔 · 赵氏","name":"杂言寄杜羔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君从淮海游，再过兰杜秋。\n归来未须臾，又欲向梁州。\n梁州秦岭西，栈道与云齐。\n羌蛮万余落，矛戟自高低。\n已念寡俦侣，复虑劳攀跻。\n丈夫重志气，儿女空悲啼。\n临邛滞游地，肯顾浊水泥。\n人生赋命有厚薄，君但遨游我寂寞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}